endOfYear: false
---
<div class="full-width">
<poem-grid :title="poemTitle" :author="author" :theme="bgTheme">

  <!-- Header Section -->
  <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-0.png" alt="" slot="header-tl" />
  <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-1.png" alt="" slot="header-tr" />

  <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-1-images">
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-6.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-8.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-10.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-12.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-14.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      As the old year fades away,
      Another comes fresh and new;
      We wonder what it will hold,
      But it really is up to you.
    </p>

    <p>
      Do you welcome it with open arms,
      Full of exciting vim and vigour;
      You’re the one at the helm,
      Being ready to pull the trigger.
    </p>

    <p>
      Or do you sit down and moan,
      To shiver in the winter cold;
      Stop feeling sorry for yourself,
      Just get up and dance – be bold.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
  <div slot="col-3-images">
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-2.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-3.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-4.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 4 Text -->
  <div slot="col-4-text">
    <p>
      You can be active all your life,
      Don’t let your body rot;
      You’ll be surprised and happy,
      If you use the strength you’ve got.
    </p>

    <p>
      In later years use a cane,
      To dance with it makes sense;
      It is there to give you support,
      And you’ll gain confidence.
    </p>

    <p>
      Go and make your resolutions now,
      This will make your moments sweet;
      Making sure this will be the year,
      That will keep you on your feet.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-5-images">
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-5.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-7.png" alt="" />
